<div class="chapter" id="ch2">
<p class="kicker">Chapter 2</p>
<h1>East-West Traffic Deep Dive</h1>

<p>
  East-west traffic moves laterally between virtual networks, subnets, and
  workloads. Weak segmentation here turns a single compromised workload into
  tenant-wide lateral movement. This chapter reviews VNet peering, routing,
  and segmentation controls
  {% if classification %} for the discovered
  <strong>{{ classification.pattern | replace("_", "-") }}</strong> topology
  ({{ classification.hub_vnet_ids | length }} hub VNet(s),
  {{ classification.spoke_vnet_ids | length }} spoke VNet(s)){% endif %}.
  {{ east_west_findings | length }} east-west finding(s) were identified.
</p>

{% if current_diagram_svg %}
<h2>Current-state topology</h2>
<div class="diagram">
  {{ current_diagram_svg | safe }}
  <div class="caption">Figure 2.1 — Discovered current-state network topology.</div>
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if topology_tables.peerings %}
<h2>VNet peering inventory</h2>
{% set pivot_title = none %}
<table>
  <tr><th>VNet</th><th>Remote VNet</th><th>State</th><th>Gateway transit</th><th>Use remote GW</th><th>Forwarded traffic</th></tr>
  {% for p in topology_tables.peerings %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ p.vnet }}</td><td>{{ p.remote }}</td><td>{{ p.state }}</td>
    <td>{{ "yes" if p.gateway_transit else "no" }}</td>
    <td>{{ "yes" if p.use_remote_gateways else "no" }}</td>
    <td>{{ "yes" if p.forwarded_traffic else "no" }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>
{% endif %}

{% if not is_condensed and topology_tables.route_tables %}
<h2>Route table inventory</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Route table</th><th>VNet</th><th>Routes</th><th>Associated subnets</th><th>BGP propagation disabled</th></tr>
  {% for rt in topology_tables.route_tables %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ rt.name }}</td><td>{{ rt.vnet }}</td><td>{{ rt.routes }}</td>
    <td>{{ rt.subnets }}</td><td>{{ "yes" if rt.bgp_propagation_disabled else "no" }}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>
{% endif %}

<h2>East-west findings</h2>
{% if east_west_findings %}
  {% for f in east_west_findings if not is_condensed or f.severity in ["CRITICAL", "HIGH"] %}
    {% include "encyclopedia/_domain_section.j2" %}
  {% else %}
    <p>No {{ "critical or high severity " if is_condensed else "" }}east-west findings to report.</p>
  {% endfor %}
{% else %}
<p>No east-west findings were identified in this assessment.</p>
{% endif %}
</div>
